**Option A: Client-side title generation** (REJECTED)
- Use browser's AI/ML capabilities
- Pros: No server cost, instant
- Cons: No browser native solution, would need to bundle model (large)

**Option B: Simple rule-based titles** (REJECTED)  
- Extract keywords, use first 30 chars
- Pros: Cheap, fast
- Cons: Not intelligent, often poor quality

**Option C: Server-side with dedicated endpoint** (SELECTED)
- Generate title after first exchange
