          <div className="flex-1 flex min-w-0">
            <div className="flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0 bg-white">
              {/* Header */}
              <header className="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5 bg-white border-b border-zinc-100 shrink-0">
                <h1 className="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary tracking-tight">
                  {currentChat?.title || "New chat"}
                </h1>
                <button 
                  onClick={() => setIsRightSidebarOpen(prev => !prev)}
                  className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors text-zinc-600"
                  title={isRightSidebarOpen ? "Hide sidebar" : "Show sidebar"}
                >
                  {isRightSidebarOpen ? (
                    <ChevronLeft className="w-4 h-4" strokeWidth={1.5} />
                  ) : (
                    <PanelRightOpen className="w-4 h-4" strokeWidth={1.5} />
                  )}
                </button>
              </header>

              {/* Messages - SCROLLS HERE */}
              {isLoading ? (
                <LoadingMessages />
              ) : error ? (
                <div className="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <div className="text-center">
                    <p className="text-zinc-500 mb-2">Failed to load chat</p>
                    <p className="text-sm text-zinc-400">{error.message}</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              ) : (
                <MessageList messages={messages} isStreaming={isStreaming} />
              )}

              {/* Input */}
              <div className="px-6 pb-4 shrink-0">
                <ChatInputContainer variant="chat" />
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Right Sidebar */}
            {isRightSidebarOpen && <RightSidebar />}
          </div>
        )}
      </main>
    </div>
  );
}

export default App;
```

**Key changes:**
- Removed `overflow-hidden` from root
- `main` is `flex-col` - direct children stack vertically
- Header has `shrink-0` - won't shrink
- Messages area uses `MessageList` directly with `flex-1` 
- Input wrapper has `shrink-0` - won't shrink
- Added `border-b` to header for visual separation
- NO extra wrapper divs around MessageList

